              "name": "Subtitle",
              "fill": "$ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Four readings of the same piece — “A room that remembers” — each treats the detail as a different kind of place: a backstage label (A), a quiet article (B), a table you can move things on (C), and a horizontal proof strip (D). All share the same data but change what feels primary.",
